4. HARDWARE CONTROL — ASSUMPTION OF RISK
   HeatPilot adjusts fan behavior by writing Apple SMC fan-control keys.
   It is designed so that Apple's automatic thermal management is restored
   by System Auto, by quitting the app, and by the helper's own shutdown
   handling — but you use hardware-control software at your own risk, and
   you are responsible for monitoring your own machine.

